# Graphene Ionic Liquid Interface MD

units real
dimension 3
boundary p p f
atom_style atomic


read_data data.interface


pair_style lj/cut 10.0
pair_coeff * * 0.1 3.0


velocity all create 300.0 12345


fix 1 all nvt temp 300.0 300.0 100.0


thermo 100

dump 1 all xyz 100 trajectory.xyz


run 10000
